{"recordId":"emperor_高演_1671236413","name":"高演","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"殷憂明主","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"齐孝昭帝","pageId":117480,"revisionId":93641648,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-25T10:02:51Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BD%90%E5%AD%9D%E6%98%AD%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93641648","wikidataId":"Q708325","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"資治通鑒卷一百六十七·陳紀一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"資治通鑒卷一百六十八·陳紀二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"隋書·卷十四·音樂中","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"文明","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"休德","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"太平御覽·卷三百七十七·人事部十八","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"[http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/beiqishu/beiqi_006.htm 北齐书·帝紀第六·孝昭]","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"[http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/beishi/beis_007.htm 北史·齐本纪中第七]","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齐书·帝紀第六·孝昭","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/beiqishu/beiqi_006.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·齐本纪中第七","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/beishi/beis_007.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.418Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:beiqishu","source:zhoushu","source:weishu","source:beishi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:beiqishu-823804a4cd3eccc2","query":"高演","count":1,"offset":18,"excerpt":"〔篇題：第六卷 補帝紀第六 孝昭帝 高演〕\n〔編者說明：孝昭帝〕\n\n孝昭皇帝演，字延安，神武皇帝第六子，文宣皇帝之母弟也。幼而英特，早有大成之量，武明皇太后早所愛重。魏元象元年，封常山郡公。及文襄執政","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-56be1c0942edca60","query":"高演","count":1,"offset":288,"excerpt":"，乃從之。壬寅，即皇帝位，大赦天下。冬十二月，改作露門、應門。\n\n是歲，齊常山王高演廢其主殷而自立，是為孝昭帝。\n\n保定元年春正月戊申，詔曰：「寒暑亟周，奄及徂歲，改元命始，國之典章。朕祗承寶圖，宜遵故實。可改武成三年為保定元年。嘉號既新，惠澤","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-c22c9b8017fbfb20","query":"高演","count":1,"offset":8038,"excerpt":"名於時，見潛書，謂為過於己也。\n\n弟　崔徽\n\n玄伯弟徽，字玄猷。少有文才，與勃海高演俱知名。初徵相州別駕、中書侍郎，稍遷祕書監，賜爵貝丘侯，加龍驤將軍。樂安王範鎮長安，世祖以範年少，而三秦民夷，恃險多變，乃選忠清舊德之士，與範俱鎮。以徽為散騎常","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-37bcddda98d8f932","query":"高演","count":1,"offset":13310,"excerpt":"知名于時，見潛書，以爲過於浩也。\n\n宏弟 徽\n\n宏弟徽，字玄猷，少有文才，與勃海高演俱知名。歷位秘書監，賜爵貝丘侯。樂安王范鎮長安，選舊德之士與範俱，以徽爲平西將軍副將，行樂安王傅，進爵濟南公。徽爲政務存大體，不親小事。性好人倫。引接賓客，或談","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:beiqishu-823804a4cd3eccc2","bookId":"book:beiqishu","requestedTitle":"北齊書/卷6","title":"北齊書/卷6","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B76","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432485","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B76?action=history","revisionId":2432485,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:20:23Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:47:02.084Z","sha256":"69ec798a3403ceeec3311802dbe9332bf49f52db7b63fe9e35072ffd5b486b67","textSha256":"8